{"product_id":"bin-ladens-oil-money-terrorism-and-the-secret-saudi-world","title":"Bin Ladens: Oil, Money, Terrorism and the Secret Saudi World","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Bin Ladens are shrouded in secrecy, living in one of the most closed, unaccountable countries on earth. Little has been known about the world that created Osama - until now.In this gripping account prizewinning journalist Steve Coll has interviewed those closest to the family who rose from Yemeni peasants to jetsetting millionaires in two generations. In doing so, he reveals a Saudi Arabia torn between religious purity and the temptations of the West, telling a story of oil, money, power, patronage and dangerous cultural extremes. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Steve Coll \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780141036489 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 688\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45073880416409,"sku":"12RC9780141036489","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/678b8f95f1608-Bin_20Ladens-_20Oil_20Money_20Terrorism_20and_20the_20Secret_20Saudi_20World_20Steve_20Coll.jpg?v=1737210461","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/bin-ladens-oil-money-terrorism-and-the-secret-saudi-world","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}